# Canonical paper experiment manifest.
#
# This file is deliberately limited to simple KEY='whitespace separated values'
# assignments so it can be sourced by Bash and parsed without executing shell
# code by src/utils/experiment_manifest.py.  It is the single source of truth
# for experiment membership, seeds, and the protocol coordinates controlled by
# scripts/run_all_experiments.sh and scripts/build_paper_results.py.

